---
import BaseLayout from "@layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ERP Implementation — Odoo | Ecosoft"
  description="Ecosoft implements Odoo Community Edition with OCA-certified modules — full Thai accounting compliance, no licence fees, full source code ownership."
>


  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero hero--purple">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="erpnext-hero-inner">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">ERP Implementation</p>
          <h1>The world's most adaptable open-source business suite. Implemented the way it was meant to be.</h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">
            Odoo is a comprehensive open-source ERP platform covering accounting, inventory,
            manufacturing, procurement, CRM, HR, and more — all in a single unified system.
            Ecosoft implements Odoo Community Edition, enhanced with OCA-certified modules,
            delivering enterprise capability without licence cost.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/case-studies" class="btn btn-primary">See Odoo Case Studies</a>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Book a Free Odoo Consultation</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-hero-card">
          <img src="/images/odoo-logo.png" alt="Odoo" class="product-hero-card-logo" />
          <div class="product-hero-card-stats">
            <div class="product-hero-stat">
              <span class="product-hero-stat-number">12M+</span>
              <span class="product-hero-stat-label">Users worldwide</span>
            </div>
            <div class="product-hero-stat">
              <span class="product-hero-stat-number">40K+</span>
              <span class="product-hero-stat-label">Add-on apps</span>
            </div>
            <div class="product-hero-stat">
              <span class="product-hero-stat-number">฿0</span>
              <span class="product-hero-stat-label">Licence fees (CE)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHAT'S INCLUDED -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">What's Included</p>
        <h2>A typical Odoo implementation with Ecosoft covers</h2>
        <p>All modules are built to OCA quality standards with full Thai localisation included.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>💰 Accounting &amp; Finance</h3>
          <p>Thai-compliant chart of accounts, VAT, withholding tax, financial reporting, and 50 Tawi certificates.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>📦 Inventory &amp; Warehouse</h3>
          <p>Multi-warehouse management, lot and serial number tracking, automated reorder rules, and landed costs.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>🛒 Purchase &amp; Procurement</h3>
          <p>PR/PO workflows, supplier evaluation, 3-way matching, and full procurement audit trail.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>📈 Sales &amp; CRM</h3>
          <p>Quotations, sales orders, customer pipeline management, and performance dashboards.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>🏭 Manufacturing (MRP)</h3>
          <p>Bill of materials, work orders, production planning, and real-time production visibility.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>👥 Human Resources</h3>
          <p>Employee records, leave management, Thai payroll, and social security compliance.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>🇹🇭 Thai Localisation</h3>
          <p>Withholding tax certificates (50 Tawi), VAT reports, Thai-language interface, and BOI compliance.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
          <h3>🔧 Custom Modules</h3>
          <p>All customisations built as reusable open-source modules — not hacks that break on upgrade.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY ECOSOFT FOR ODOO -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why Ecosoft for Odoo</p>
        <h2>OCA quality standards. Full source code. No lock-in.</h2>
        <p>
          As OCA members, we implement Odoo to the highest global quality standard. Every customisation
          is built as a reusable open-source module — not a shortcut that breaks on the next upgrade.
          You receive full source code at project completion.
        </p>
      </header>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">01</span>
          <h3>OCA Member</h3>
          <p>Thailand's only OCA-member implementor. Our modules are peer-reviewed, tested, and built to international standards.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">02</span>
          <h3>Community Edition Only</h3>
          <p>We work exclusively with Odoo CE — no per-user licence fees. That budget goes toward better implementation and training.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">03</span>
          <h3>Thai Expertise Built In</h3>
          <p>Over 10 years implementing Thai accounting, VAT, and procurement compliance — not bolted on after the fact.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card pillar-card">
          <span class="pillar-number">04</span>
          <h3>Full Source Code Delivery</h3>
          <p>At project completion you receive everything. Maintain it yourself, hand it to any developer, extend it freely.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-strip">
    <div class="container cta-strip-grid">
      <div class="cta-strip-item">
        <h3>Ready to see Odoo in action?</h3>
        <p>Book a free 45-minute live demo tailored to your business and industry.</p>
        <a href="/book-demo" class="btn btn-white">Book a Free Demo</a>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-strip-item">
        <h3>Comparing Odoo vs ERPNext?</h3>
        <p>We implement both and have no commercial incentive to recommend one over the other. Get an honest guide.</p>
        <a href="/resources/odoo-vs-erpnext" class="btn btn-teal-outline">Compare Odoo vs ERPNext →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
